Hall in Harwich, Massachusetts.

00:00:17.866 --> 00:00:22.333
Uh, participation is possible.
Participation in the meeting is

00:00:22.333 --> 00:00:25.300
possible in the room or online
through GoToMeeting.

00:00:25.466 --> 00:00:31.200
Instructions for joining the
meeting online can be found.
